 DOS CLASSICS (run them in DOSBox Staging, see TOOLS.NFO)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 SCORCH15.ZIP ..... Scorched Earth 1.5 (1995), "The Mother of All Games".
                    Wendell Hicken gives it away free on whicken.com (you
                    can tip him there for the Totally Scorched collection).

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 WINDOWS-ONLY PORTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ABUSE-WIN.ZIP .... Abuse (1996), Crack dot Com's run-and-gun. The code and
                    data were put in the public domain; this port is by
                    Xenoveritas (github.com/Xenoveritas/abuse). The original
                    sound effects aren't included (see the port's readme).
 LIERO.ZIP ........ Liero 1.36 (1998), the worm deathmatch, with OpenLiero.
                    Freeware by Joosa Riekkinen, now under the WTFPL.
                    From github.com/gliptic/liero.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 MAC USERS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 The first time you open ScummVM or Zeta, macOS may refuse. Right-click the
 app, choose Open, then Open again (or System Settings > Privacy & Security
 > Open Anyway).

